<?xml version="1.0" encoding="utf-8"?><rss version="2.0" xmlns:atom="http://www.w3.org/2005/Atom"><channel><title>Generative Reward Model</title><link>https://jaehun.me/tags/generative-reward-model/</link><description>딥러닝 컴파일러 엔지니어 류재훈의 기술 블로그. LLM 추론 최적화, KV 캐시, 컴파일러, C++와 AI 논문·오픈소스 코드 분석을 정리합니다.</description><language>ko-kr</language><atom:link href="https://jaehun.me/tags/generative-reward-model/index.xml" rel="self" type="application/rss+xml"/><item><title>Inference-Time Scaling for Generalist Reward Modeling</title><link>https://jaehun.me/posts/inference-time-scaling-for-generalist-reward-modeling/</link><guid isPermaLink="true">https://jaehun.me/posts/inference-time-scaling-for-generalist-reward-modeling/</guid><pubDate>Tue, 08 Jul 2025 00:00:00 +0900</pubDate><description>&lt;p&gt;&lt;a&#10; href="https://arxiv.org/abs/2504.02495v2"target="_blank"&#10; class="inline-flex items-center gap-1"&#10; &gt;논문 링크&lt;svg class="h-3 w-3 flex-shrink-0" id="external-link" xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" viewBox="0 0 24 24"&gt;&lt;path fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" stroke-width="2" d="M15 3h6v6m-11 5L21 3m-3 10v6a2 2 0 0 1-2 2H5a2 2 0 0 1-2-2V8a2 2 0 0 1 2-2h6"/&gt;&lt;/svg&gt;&#10; &lt;/a&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&#10;&lt;h2 id="inference-time-scaling-deepseek-grm이-초대형-모델을-넘어선-비결"&gt;Inference-Time Scaling: DeepSeek-GRM이 초대형 모델을 넘어선 비결&lt;a href="#inference-time-scaling-deepseek-grm%ec%9d%b4-%ec%b4%88%eb%8c%80%ed%98%95-%eb%aa%a8%eb%8d%b8%ec%9d%84-%eb%84%98%ec%96%b4%ec%84%a0-%eb%b9%84%ea%b2%b0" class="heading-anchor" aria-label="이 섹션에 대한 링크"&gt;&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/h2&gt;&lt;h2 id="한-줄-요약-tldr"&gt;한 줄 요약 (TL;DR)&lt;a href="#%ed%95%9c-%ec%a4%84-%ec%9a%94%ec%95%bd-tldr" class="heading-anchor" aria-label="이 섹션에 대한 링크"&gt;&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/h2&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;“27 B 모델 × 32배 샘플”&lt;/strong&gt;—Generative Reward Model(GRM)과 k-Vote 합산만으로 GPT-4o·Nemotron-340B보다 높은 &lt;strong&gt;종합 정확도 72.8 %&lt;/strong&gt;를 기록, &lt;em&gt;모델 크기 대신 추론 컴퓨트&lt;/em&gt;라는 새로운 스케일링 축을 제시했다.&lt;/p&gt;</description></item></channel></rss>